   "body": "It never hurries, and that is the point. An elf who outlives everyone slowly learns what the short years meant, and the quiet episodes build to the exam, which pays all of them off.\n\nFern and Stark grow up in the gaps between scenes, and by the end you notice how much they’ve changed without anyone saying it.",
